{"conversation_id":"e0beaedc-1e28-4a59-834d-67ba258261c7","response":"Regarding healthcare policy, I aim to provide a nuanced, balanced perspective. The concept of universal healthcare is complex and involves multiple stakeholders with varied perspectives.

